15
Display the employees from EMP table and sort only employees
working in DALLAS.
(Scalar Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, JOB, DEPTNO
     FROM EMP
     ORDER BY
     CASE
         WHEN DEPTNO =
         (
             SELECT DEPTNO
             FROM DEPT
             WHERE LOC='DALLAS'
         )
         THEN ENAME
     END;

